  "question": {
    "text": "The system of linear equations<br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "is inconsistent when  <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "has a unique solution for  <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "has infinitely many solutions for  <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "is inconsistent when  <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Here,  <math><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math> <br/><br/>        Hence at  <math><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> ,  <math><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> . So system don't have unique solution.<br/><br/>        At  <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> ,  <math><mi>D</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , So, system has unique solution. Hence not inconsistent.<br/><br/>        At  <math><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  and  <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></math>  &  <math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></math>  equation are parallel. Hence no solution are possible.<br/><br/>        Hence, system is inconsistent for  <math><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>"
  }
